      "body": "Thanks for the explanation! This code is one of those places that I go \"eew\" every time I dive in on it; challenging to reason about and hard to craft reliable specific regression tests for.\r\n\r\nI like the after state of this change better. Definitely cleaner to keep the clearing and use in one place.",
